' Một mô hình duy nhất, mỗi lớp xuất hiện một lần.
' Bố cục báo cáo được cố định tại ../tikz/system-class-overview.tex.
@startuml
!include design-style.puml
top to bottom direction
hide members
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 70
class Account
class AccessAssignment
abstract class Vehicle
class PrivateVehicle
class SharedVehicle
class MobilityHub
class VehicleReservation
class Trip
class ParkingSpace
class ParkingReservation
class ChargingPoint
class ChargingRequest
class ChargingSession
class SimulationScenario
class SimulationRun
class Recommendation
class RedistributionPlan
class Incident
Vehicle <|-- SharedVehicle
Vehicle <|-- PrivateVehicle
Account "1" -- "0..*" AccessAssignment
Account "1" -- "0..*" PrivateVehicle : chủ xe
Account "1" -- "0..*" VehicleReservation : sinh viên
Account "1" -- "0..*" ParkingReservation : sinh viên
MobilityHub "1" -- "0..*" SharedVehicle : thuộc Hub
MobilityHub "1" -- "0..*" ParkingSpace
MobilityHub "1" -- "0..*" ChargingPoint
SharedVehicle "1" -- "0..*" VehicleReservation
SharedVehicle "1" -- "0..*" Trip
VehicleReservation "1" -- "0..1" Trip : bàn giao
ParkingSpace "1" -- "0..*" ParkingReservation
PrivateVehicle "1" -- "0..*" ParkingReservation
Vehicle "1" -- "0..*" ChargingRequest
ChargingPoint "0..1" -- "0..*" ChargingRequest : phân bổ
ChargingPoint "1" -- "0..*" ChargingSession
ChargingRequest "1" -- "0..*" ChargingSession
SimulationScenario "1" -- "0..*" SimulationRun
SimulationRun "1" -- "0..*" Recommendation
Recommendation "0..1" -- "0..*" RedistributionPlan : nguồn đề xuất
RedistributionPlan -[hidden]down- Incident
note right of Incident
  Incident: resourceType / resourceId.
  Kế hoạch: xe, Hub nguồn / đích.
  Giữ liên kết lịch sử khi hết hiệu lực.
end note
@enduml
